      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاعَتِ الإِبِلُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسُوعُ</span>, (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوْعٌ</span>,
