<i>without a pastor;</i> (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ساعت</span> with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسِيعُ</span> for its aor. and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْعٌ</span> for its inf. n. (Sh.)

